Removed the null-check branch by substituting a zero-initialized dummy `Profile` when `profile` is null, so the unsigned index comparison alone safely returns 0.

```cpp
FIT_FLOAT64 Field::GetOffset() const
{
    static const Profile dummy = {};
    const Profile* p = profile ? profile : &dummy;
    if (profileIndex >= p->numFields)
        return 0;
    return p->fields[profileIndex].offset;
}
```